    "title": "Wayland Woman Arrested on Felony Probation Violation Charges - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jennifer Wilkerson ,\n16 hours ago A Wayland woman was arrested Friday on felony probation violation charges, and new charges of possession of drug paraphernalia and possession of a controlled substance. The Washington County Sheriff’s Office arrested 32-year-old Nikita Williams after a traffic stop on two Washington County warrants, both for violation of probation on the original charges of possession of contraband in a correctional institution and identity theft. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
